// filter-selects.test.maxon — `--filter` selects, and the test it leaves out would FAIL if it ran — so a filter that
// quietly kept everything is a red run rather than an invisible one.
//
// One spawning `test` per file — `fixtures.test.maxon`'s header owns why.

test 'filter-selects runs only the test the filter names'
	try checkFixture("filter-selects")
end 'filter-selects runs only the test the filter names'
